{
  "name": "暗示术",
  "automation": "partial",
  "text": "30 尺内你能看见的一个生物进行感知豁免，失败在法术持续时间内陷入魅惑状态（专注至多 8 小时）。被魅惑生物尽其所能执行你描述的行动暗示（必须听起来可行且非自残自伤）。施法者或其盟友对其造成伤害时法术提前结束。暗示内容理解、行为执行及达成目标后法术终止需手动处理。",
  "actions": [
    {
      "id": "cast",
      "name": "暗示术",
      "activation": "action",
      "tags": [
        "spell",
        "magical"
      ],
      "cost": [
        {
          "slot": {
            "min": 2
          }
        }
      ],
      "concentration": {
        "hours": 8
      },
      "targeting": {
        "type": "creature",
        "count": 1,
        "range": 30,
        "filter": "canSee(self, target)"
      },
      "root": [
        {
          "kind": "save",
          "ability": "wis",
          "dc": "self.spell.dc",
          "onFail": [
            {
              "kind": "applyEffect",
              "template": "暗示术",
              "to": "target"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "effects": {
    "暗示术": {
      "tags": [
        "magical",
        "spell"
      ],
      "implies": [
        "XPHB:condition:魅惑"
      ],
      "duration": {
        "hours": 8,
        "endsOn": [
          {
            "event": "damageApplied",
            "when": "event.target == self.id && event.total > 0 && (event.source == source.id || (event.source != null && combatant(event.source).isAllyOf(source)))"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "陷入魅惑状态，尽其所能执行暗示行为；施法者或其盟友对其造成伤害时法术提前结束；完成要求后法术终止。"
    }
  }
}
